    { math: '4 · One people, many streams', note: 'Orthodox (halakhah binding), Conservative, Reform (autonomy in observance), plus Hasidism (mystical, 18th c.), Sephardi and Mizrahi traditions. Ethnicity and religion intertwine: Jewish identity includes people who practice nothing.' },
